<title>SRI LANKA: Sri Lanka forex market closed for holiday.</title>
<headline>Sri Lanka forex market closed for holiday.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Sri Lankan forex market was closed on Friday for a religious holiday.</p>
<p>On Thursday, the rupee closed higher at 57.45 to the dollar. It closed at 57.28 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Trading will resume on Monday.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941)-434319</p>
</text>
